  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LEBANON EMERGENCY CRISIS AND COVID-19 RESPONSE SOCIAL SAFETY NET PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to: (a) provide cash transfers and access to social services to extreme poor and vulnerable Lebanese populations affected by the economic and COVID-19 crises in Lebanon; and (b) in case of an Eligible Crisis or Emergencycomma provide immediate and effective response to such emergency or crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
